},
{
"start": 126.0,
"end": 127.81,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "That's a helpful context.",
"char_start": 2898,
"char_end": 2923,
"unit_id": "t0016.u01",
"sent_id": "t0016.s02"
},
{
"start": 127.81,
"end": 132.0,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Where do maintenance and transmission mechanics intersect?",
"char_start": 2924,
"char_end": 2982,
"unit_id": "t0016.u01",
"sent_id": "t0016.s03"
},
{
"start": 132.0,
"end": 132.43,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 2998,
"char_end": 3018,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s01"
},
{
"start": 132.43,
"end": 135.15,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "Most mysterious creaking noises are resolved by cleaning the contact surfaces and re-tightening them to the specified torque.",
"char_start": 3019,
"char_end": 3144,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s02"
},
{
"start": 135.15,
"end": 136.5,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "We've seen this happen with teams that use Shimano components.",
"char_start": 3145,
"char_end": 3207,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s03"
},
{
"start": 136.5,
"end": 138.0,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "I've observed this pattern repeating itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 3208,
"char_end": 3277,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s04"
},
{
"start": 138.0,
"end": 139.5,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Give me a concrete example.",
"char_start": 3295,
"char_end": 3322,
"unit_id": "t0018.u01",
"sent_id": "t0018.s01"
},
{
"start": 139.5,
"end": 144.0,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "What did you previously believe about this, and have you since changed your mind?",
"char_start": 3323,
"char_end": 3404,
"unit_id": "t0018.u01",
"sent_id": "t0018.s02"
},
{
"start": 144.0,
"end": 147.72,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "Yes, so – a bicycle should feel quiet and predictable so that your attention can remain focused on the trail.",
"char_start": 3420,
"char_end": 3529,
"unit_id": "t0019.u01",
"sent_id": "t0019.s01"
},
{
"start": 147.72,
"end": 150.0,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "Once you internalize that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
"char_start": 3530,
"char_end": 3597,
"unit_id": "t0019.u01",
"sent_id": "t0019.s02"
},
{
"start": 150.0,
"end": 151.28,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Let's start with that.",
"char_start": 3615,
"char_end": 3637,
"unit_id": "t0020.u01",
"sent_id": "t0020.s01"
},
{
"start": 151.28,
"end": 156.0,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "What did you believe about this, and what have you since learned or reconsidered?",
"char_start": 3638,
"char_end": 3719,
"unit_id": "t0020.u01",
"sent_id": "t0020.s02"
},
{
"start": 156.0,
"end": 156.51,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 3735,
"char_end": 3755,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s01"
},
{
"start": 156.51,
"end": 158.91,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "The wear on the chain is the best early indicator of when you'll need to replace the cassette.",
"char_start": 3756,
"char_end": 3850,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s02"
},
{
"start": 158.91,
"end": 160.31,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "We've seen this with teams that use Shimano components.",
"char_start": 3851,
"char_end": 3906,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s03"
},
{
"start": 160.31,
"end": 162.0,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
"char_start": 3907,
"char_end": 3973,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s04"
},
{
"start": 162.0,
"end": 168.0,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "That makes sense.",
"char_start": 3991,
"char_end": 4008,
"unit_id": "t0022.u01",
"sent_id": "t0022.s01"
},
{
"start": 168.0,
"end": 174.0,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "And when teams adopt Spoke & Wrench within that workflow, the commitment becomes evident. If you ignore that, you end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
"char_start": 4024,
"char_end": 4200,
"unit_id": "t0023.u01",
"sent_id": "t0023.s01"
},
{
"start": 174.0,
"end": 175.14,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Let's start there.",
"char_start": 4218,
"char_end": 4236,
"unit_id": "t0024.u01",
"sent_id": "t0024.s01"
},
{
"start": 175.14,
"end": 180.0,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "What is the operational perspective that most listeners don't have access to?",
"char_start": 4237,
"char_end": 4314,
"unit_id": "t0024.u01",
"sent_id": "t0024.s02"
},
{
"start": 180.0,
"end": 180.74,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 4330,
"char_end": 4350,
"unit_id": "t0025.u01",
"sent_id": "t0025.s01"
},
{
"start": 180.74,
"end": 183.56,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "The maintenance intervals for the suspension are a risk management decision.",
"char_start": 4351,
"char_end": 4427,
"unit_id": "t0025.u01",
"sent_id": "t0025.s02"
},
{
"start": 183.56,
"end": 186.0,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "I observed this pattern repeating itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 4428,
"char_end": 4494,
"unit_id": "t0025.u01",
"sent_id": "t0025.s03"
},
{
"start": 186.0,
"end": 192.0,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Let's change the subject – I want to dedicate the final section to risk management.",
"char_start": 4512,
"char_end": 4595,
"unit_id": "t0026.u01",
"sent_id": "t0026.s01"
},
{
"start": 192.0,
"end": 198.0,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "That's where the conversation gets interesting, because the considerations surrounding risk management are relevant to everything we've discussed.",
"char_start": 4611,
"char_end": 4757,
"unit_id": "t0027.u01",
"sent_id": "t0027.s01"
},
{
"start": 198.0,
"end": 199.76,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Give me a concrete example.",
"char_start": 4775,
"char_end": 4802,
"unit_id": "t0028.u01",
"sent_id": "t0028.s01"
},
{
"start": 199.76,
"end": 204.0,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "What is the most underestimated aspect of transmission mechanics?",
"char_start": 4803,
"char_end": 4868,
"unit_id": "t0028.u01",
"sent_id": "t0028.s02"
},
{
"start": 204.0,
"end": 204.22,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "Certainly.",
"char_start": 4884,
"char_end": 4894,
"unit_id": "t0029.u01",
"sent_id": "t0029.s01"
},
{
"start": 204.22,
"end": 207.18,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "Most mysterious creaking noises can be resolved by cleaning the contact surfaces and re-tightening the bolts to the specified torque.",
"char_start": 4895,
"char_end": 5028,
"unit_id": "t0029.u01",
"sent_id": "t0029.s02"
},
{
"start": 207.18,
"end": 208.47,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "We've seen this happen with teams that use Spoke & Wrench.",
"char_start": 5029,
"char_end": 5087,
"unit_id": "t0029.u01",
"sent_id": "t0029.s03"
},
{
"start": 208.47,
"end": 210.0,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "I've observed this pattern repeating itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 5088,
"char_end": 5157,
"unit_id": "t0029.u01",
"sent_id": "t0029.s04"
},
{
"start": 210.0,
"end": 211.59,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "It's a useful perspective.",
"char_start": 5175,
"char_end": 5201,
"unit_id": "t0030.u01",
"sent_id": "t0030.s01"
},
{
"start": 211.59,
"end": 216.0,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "What is the opposing viewpoint that most listeners don't have access to?",
"char_start": 5202,
"char_end": 5274,
"unit_id": "t0030.u01",
"sent_id": "t0030.s02"
},
{
"start": 216.0,
"end": 219.29,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "In essence, a bicycle should feel quiet and predictable so that your focus remains on the trail.",
"char_start": 5290,
"char_end": 5386,
"unit_id": "t0031.u01",
"sent_id": "t0031.s01"
},
{
"start": 219.29,
"end": 222.0,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "The frame matters because it tells you what kind of performance you can expect.",
"char_start": 5387,
"char_end": 5466,
"unit_id": "t0031.u01",
"sent_id": "t0031.s02"
},
{
"start": 222.0,
"end": 223.67,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "What is the failure mode?",
"char_start": 5484,
"char_end": 5509,
"unit_id": "t0032.u01",
"sent_id": "t0032.s01"
},
{
"start": 223.67,
"end": 228.0,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "What is the most underestimated aspect of transmission mechanics?",
"char_start": 5510,
"char_end": 5575,
"unit_id": "t0032.u01",
"sent_id": "t0032.s02"
},
{
"start": 228.0,
"end": 230.76,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "Honestly, the wear on the chain is the best early indicator of when you'll need to replace the cassette.",
"char_start": 5591,
"char_end": 5695,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s01"
},
{
"start": 230.76,
"end": 232.17,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use Shimano components.",
"char_start": 5696,
"char_end": 5749,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s02"
},
{
"start": 232.17,
"end": 234.0,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "I've observed this pattern repeating itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 5750,
"char_end": 5819,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s03"
},
{
"start": 234.0,
"end": 240.0,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Where does it stop working?",
"char_start": 5837,
"char_end": 5864,
"unit_id": "t0034.u01",
"sent_id": "t0034.s01"
},
{
"start": 240.0,
"end": 246.0,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "And when teams embrace Shimano in that way, the commitment becomes evident – I saw this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 5880,
"char_end": 6015,
"unit_id": "t0035.u01",
"sent_id": "t0035.s01"
},
{
"start": 246.0,
"end": 248.45,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "What heuristic do you always go back to?",
"char_start": 6033,
"char_end": 6073,
"unit_id": "t0036.u01",
"sent_id": "t0036.s01"
},
{
"start": 248.45,
"end": 252.0,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Where do maintenance and transmission mechanics intersect?",
"char_start": 6074,
"char_end": 6132,
"unit_id": "t0036.u01",
"sent_id": "t0036.s02"
},
{
"start": 252.0,
"end": 255.35,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "Honestly, the maintenance intervals for the suspension are a risk management decision.",
"char_start": 6148,
"char_end": 6234,
"unit_id": "t0037.u01",
"sent_id": "t0037.s01"
},
{
"start": 255.35,
"end": 258.0,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "And the secondary effect is the part that almost everyone overlooks.",
"char_start": 6235,
"char_end": 6303,
"unit_id": "t0037.u01",
"sent_id": "t0037.s02"
},
{
"start": 258.0,
"end": 264.0,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Before we finish, what's one thing listeners can try out this week?",
"char_start": 6321,
"char_end": 6388,
"unit_id": "t0038.u01",
"sent_id": "t0038.s01"
},
{
"start": 264.0,
"end": 268.13,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "Choose one of the ideas we discussed and apply it for two weeks.",
"char_start": 6404,
"char_end": 6468,
"unit_id": "t0039.u01",
"sent_id": "t0039.s01"
},
{
"start": 268.13,
"end": 270.0,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "Everything else is iteration.",
"char_start": 6469,
"char_end": 6498,
"unit_id": "t0039.u01",
"sent_id": "t0039.s02"
},
{
"start": 270.0,
"end": 272.42,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Before we close, thank you again to our friends at Linear.",
"char_start": 6516,
"char_end": 6574,
"unit_id": "t0040.u01",
"sent_id": "t0040.s01"
},
{
"start": 272.42,
"end": 276.0,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Linear is a task management tool designed for speed – it's optimized for keyboard use.",
"char_start": 6575,
"char_end": 6661,
"unit_id": "t0040.u01",
"sent_id": "t0040.s02"
},
{
"start": 276.0,
"end": 282.0,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Tiago Moreira, thank you for the conversation.",
"char_start": 6662,
"char_end": 6708,
"unit_id": "t0040.u01",
"sent_id": "t0040.s03"
},
{
"start": 282.0,
"end": 288.0,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "Thank you, Beatriz.",
"char_start": 6724,
"char_end": 6743,
"unit_id": "t0041.u01",
"sent_id": "t0041.s01"
},
{
"start": 288.0,
"end": 292.07,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "That's all for today's Trail Sessions.",
"char_start": 6761,
"char_end": 6799,
"unit_id": "t0042.u01",
"sent_id": "t0042.s01"
},
{
"start": 292.07,
"end": 294.0,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "See you next time.",
"char_start": 6800,
"char_end": 6818,
"unit_id": "t0042.u01",
"sent_id": "t0042.s02"
}
]